#: ../../source/generated/release_notes.md:8
msgid "1.8.1 (2026-11-12)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/generated/release_notes.md:11
msgid ""
"This release fixes linking of tile libraries (`.tilelib`) for the foreign"
" call preview feature in environments where the CUDA toolkit is installed"
" only from pip wheels. On Linux and Windows x64, `tileiras` 13.5 could "
"not find nvJitLink in the layout of the CUDA pip wheels. The `cuda-tile-"
"preview` package now works around this by pointing `tileiras` at a "
"temporary mirror of the toolkit for each compilation that links tile "
"libraries. The package also gains a `tileiras` extra (`pip install cuda-"
"tile-preview[tileiras]`) that installs the CUDA 13.5 `tileiras` toolchain"
" from pip."
msgstr ""
"此版本修复了在仅通过 pip wheel 安装 CUDA 工具包的环境中，外部调用预览特性链接 Tile 库（`.tilelib`）失败的问题。在"
" Linux 和 Windows x64 上，由于 CUDA pip wheel 的目录布局原因，`tileiras` 13.5 无法找到 "
"nvJitLink。`cuda-tile-preview` 包现会在每次需要链接 Tile 库的编译过程中，为 `tileiras` "
"创建一个临时工具包镜像目录来解决该问题。同时该包还新增了 `tileiras` 可选安装项（`pip install cuda-tile-"
"preview[tileiras]`），用于从 pip 安装 CUDA 13.5 的 `tileiras` 工具链。"

#: ../../source/generated/release_notes.md:21
msgid "1.8.0 (2026-11-04)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/generated/release_notes.md:24
msgid ""
"This release adds support for CTK 13.5 features, including a preview of "
"foreign calls into TileIR libraries (`.tilelib`), FP8 on Ada GPUs, and a "
"wider range of `num_worker_warps` values. It adds Python 3.15 and 3.15t "
"(free-threading) support and drops Python 3.10. It also adds explicit "
"wrap-around integer arithmetic with `ct.wrapping_add()`, "
"`ct.wrapping_sub()` and `ct.wrapping_mul()`, and makes integer overflow "
"on strictly typed scalar constants a compile-time error."
msgstr ""
"此版本新增对 CTK 13.5 特性的支持，包括外部调用 TileIR 库（`.tilelib`）预览版、Ada 架构 GPU 上的 FP8 "
"支持，以及更宽范围的 `num_worker_warps` 取值。同时新增对 Python 3.15 及 3.15t（自由线程版）的支持，并移除对"
" Python 3.10 的支持。此外还通过 `ct.wrapping_add()`、`ct.wrapping_sub()` 和 "
"`ct.wrapping_mul()` 引入了显式溢出回绕整数运算，并将严格类型化标量常量上的整数溢出改为编译期错误。"

#: ../../source/generated/release_notes.md:32
msgid "CTK 13.5 features"
msgstr "CTK 13.5 特性"

#: ../../source/generated/release_notes.md:33
msgid ""
"Add a preview of foreign calls API, available in the new [`cuda-tile-"
"preview`](https://pypi.org/project/cuda-tile-preview/) package for public"
" preview features. Install it separately alongside `cuda-tile` via `pip "
"install cuda-tile-preview`. Tile kernels can call SIMT functions supplied"
" by TileIR libraries (`.tilelib`). This requires TileIR bytecode version "
"13.5 or later."
msgstr ""
"新增外部调用（foreign calls）API 预览版，由专门承载公开预览特性的新包 [`cuda-tile-"
"preview`](https://pypi.org/project/cuda-tile-preview/) 提供。可通过 `pip "
"install cuda-tile-preview` 与 `cuda-tile` 一同单独安装。Tile 内核现可调用由 TileIR "
"库（`.tilelib`）提供的 SIMT 函数。这需要 TileIR 字节码版本 13.5 或更高版本。"

#: ../../source/generated/release_notes.md:39
msgid ""
"Add a foreign-pointer dtype that exposes an array's base pointer to "
"foreign calls. An array can be reconstructed from a foreign pointer "
"together with its shape and stride metadata."
msgstr "新增外部指针（foreign-pointer）dtype，用于向外部调用暴露数组的基地址指针。可结合外部指针及其形状与步长元数据重建数组。"

#: ../../source/generated/release_notes.md:42
msgid ""
"Automatically initialize and finalize the loaded CUDA library when a "
"kernel contains foreign calls whose symbols start with `nvshmem_` or "
"`nvshmemx_`."
msgstr "当内核中包含以 `nvshmem_` 或 `nvshmemx_` 开头的外部调用符号时，自动初始化并清理已加载的 CUDA 库。"

#: ../../source/generated/release_notes.md:44
msgid ""
"Enable `float8_e4m3fn` and `float8_e5m2` on Ada GPUs (SM89) with tileiras"
" 13.5 or later."
msgstr ""
"在配合 tileiras 13.5 及更高版本使用时，在 Ada 架构 GPU（SM89）上启用 `float8_e4m3fn` 和 "
"`float8_e5m2`。"

#: ../../source/generated/release_notes.md:46
msgid ""
"Expand the `num_worker_warps` compiler option to accept powers of two "
"from 1 through 32 with CTK 13.5 or later. CTK 13.3 and 13.4 continue to "
"support 4 and 8."
msgstr ""
"在 CTK 13.5 及更高版本下，将 `num_worker_warps` 编译器选项扩展为支持 1 到 32 之间所有 2 的幂；CTK "
"13.3 和 13.4 仍支持 4 和 8。"

