#: ../../source/generated/release_notes.md:69
msgid ""
"Add support for strictly typed constants in `ct.static_eval()`, "
"`ct.static_assert()`, and other statically evaluated expressions. "
"Previously, a strictly typed scalar constant decayed to a Python `int` "
"inside such expressions. It is now represented as a `ct.Tile` instance."
msgstr ""
"在 `ct.static_eval()`、`ct.static_assert()` "
"及其他静态求值表达式中新增对严格类型化常量的支持。此前严格类型化的标量常量在这类表达式中会退化为 Python `int`，现在则表示为 "
"`ct.Tile` 实例。"

#: ../../source/generated/release_notes.md:74
msgid "Breaking Changes"
msgstr "破坏性变更"

#: ../../source/generated/release_notes.md:75
msgid "Drop support for Python 3.10."
msgstr "移除对 Python 3.10 的支持。"

#: ../../source/generated/release_notes.md:76
msgid ""
"Integer overflow in arithmetic on strictly typed scalar constants is now "
"a compile-time error. Previously, an expression like `ct.uint8(255) + "
"ct.uint8(3)` silently wrapped around to 2. To get wrap-around behavior, "
"use `ct.wrapping_add()`, `ct.wrapping_sub()`, or `ct.wrapping_mul()` "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"严格类型化标量常量算术运算中的整数溢出将直接触发编译期错误。此前诸如 `ct.uint8(255) + ct.uint8(3)` "
"的表达式会静默回绕为 2；如需回绕行为，请改用 `ct.wrapping_add()`、`ct.wrapping_sub()` 或 "
"`ct.wrapping_mul()`。"

#: ../../source/generated/release_notes.md:83
