#: ../../source/generated/release_notes.md:131
msgid "1.6.0 (2026-09-09)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/generated/release_notes.md:134
msgid ""
"This release adds support for CTK 13.4 features, including programmatic "
"dependent launch, unchecked memory accesses, `ct.insert()`, and "
"`float8_e5m3fnu` scale dtype support for FP4 block-scaled MMA on Rubin. "
"It also adds finer control over compilation and execution with static "
"array strides and portable TileIR bytecode export. It expands the "
"supported Python subset with user-defined context managers, dataclass "
"methods, `break` in non-static loops, and integer `divmod`. Autotuning, "
"JAX interoperability, diagnostics, and floating-point behavior are also "
"improved."
msgstr ""
"此版本新增对 CTK 13.4 特性的支持，包括编程式依赖启动（Programmatic Dependent "
"Launch）、跳过越界检查的内存访问、`ct.insert()` 以及面向 Rubin 架构 FP4 分块缩放 MMA 的 "
"`float8_e5m3fnu` 缩放 dtype 支持。同时新增静态数组步长和可移植 TileIR "
"字节码导出，提供更精细的编译与执行控制；扩展了受支持的 Python 子集，新增用户自定义上下文管理器、dataclass 方法、非静态循环中的 "
"`break` 以及整数 `divmod`；并进一步改进了自动调优、JAX 互操作性、错误诊断和浮点运算行为。"

