#: ../../source/generated/release_notes.md:243
msgid ""
"This release adds finer control over kernel specialization by making "
"selected array shape dimensions compile-time constants and declaring "
"scalar divisibility assumptions. Autotuning is faster and can isolate "
"hanging kernels. The supported Python subset now includes tuple "
"comprehensions, tuple-valued kernel arguments, enums, dictionaries, and "
"variadic keyword parameters."
msgstr ""
"此版本通过支持将选定数组形状维度设为编译期常量及声明标量整除性假设，提供了更精细的内核特化控制；自动调优速度更快且可隔离卡死的内核。受支持的 "
"Python 子集现已包含元组推导式、元组类型内核参数、枚举、字典以及可变关键字参数。"

#: ../../source/generated/release_notes.md:251
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Add {py:func}`ct.assume_divisible_by(x, divisor) "
"<cuda.tile.assume_divisible_by>`, a compiler hint that declares an "
"integer scalar to be divisible by a constant. The compiler propagates "
"this fact through arithmetic, which can prove the alignment of derived "
"indices and pointer offsets and enable wider memory operations."
msgstr ""
"新增 {py:func}`ct.assume_divisible_by(x, divisor) "
"<cuda.tile.assume_divisible_by>` "
"编译器提示，用于声明整数标量可被常量整除。编译器会沿算术运算传播该假设，从而证明派生索引和指针偏移量的对齐性并启用更宽的内存访存指令。"

#: ../../source/generated/release_notes.md:256
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Add support for specializing array shape dimensions to their launch-time "
"values, making them compile-time constants inside the kernel. Use "
"{py:class}`ct.ArrayAnnotation <cuda.tile.ArrayAnnotation>` as `Annotated`"
" metadata and list the dimensions to specialize, for example, "
"`Annotated[ct.Array, ct.ArrayAnnotation(static_shape_dims=(0, -1))]`."
msgstr ""
"新增将数组形状维度特化为启动时取值的功能，使其在内核内部成为编译期常量。可将 {py:class}`ct.ArrayAnnotation "
"<cuda.tile.ArrayAnnotation>` 用作 `Annotated` 元数据并列出要特化的维度，例如 "
"`Annotated[ct.Array, ct.ArrayAnnotation(static_shape_dims=(0, -1))]`。"

#: ../../source/generated/release_notes.md:261
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Add the `single_run_timeout_sec` argument to "
"{py:func}`ct.tune.exhaustive_search() <cuda.tile.tune.exhaustive_search>`"
" to prevent a hanging kernel from stalling the entire search."
msgstr ""
"为 {py:func}`ct.tune.exhaustive_search() "
"<cuda.tile.tune.exhaustive_search>` 新增 `single_run_timeout_sec` "
"参数，以防止单个卡死的内核阻塞整个搜索流程。"

#: ../../source/generated/release_notes.md:265
msgid ""
